# Discussion (thesis Ch 8)

Interpret estimated families only. First sentence of a paragraph is the claim.
Do not restate Chapter 7 CIs. Do not open with a summary of findings
(`sec:disc-summary` is dead). Conclusion is the wrap; do not overwrite it.

## Never write

- The EEG response “depends on how and when” (fuses Dataset A state with Dataset B event)
