- “Allocation of neural processing”, captured attention, active processing, “before the text”
- Explicit-late as an attractive compromise / serving rule / *price of attention* as policy
- Holm-80%, MDE, “approached significance”, powered-replication sermon
- Holm-null on \(\delta^{(a)}\) as a verdict that Definitions 1–6 are false

